      "raw": "Hey guys. My boardgaming group and I are participating in the Extra Life charity marathon on 10/20. We&#39;re planning on playing board games for 24 hours straight to raise money for Children&#39;s Miracle Network hospitals, in our case Duke Children&#39;s Hospital.\n\nWe don&#39;t have any games finalized, but I would really love to see if we can work in a game against every SotM villain (individually!). That couldn&#39;t possibly take much longer than... 10 hours of our time, right? Not sure if the rest of the guys would be up for it, but if I can get some donations in support of that plan that can only help.<br /><br />If you&#39;re interested in donating, you can do so [url=http://www.extra-life.org/index.cfm?fuseaction=donorDrive.participant&amp;eventID=508&amp;participantID=30818]here[/url]. Thanks!\n",
